    <h2>Why I added AI to dairy cattle into my crop AI portfolio</h2>

    <p class="lead">
      I spent a decade measuring plants. In 2026 I started measuring cows. This page explains why, and what MooMore is for.
    </p>

    <p>
      MooMore has its own site — for how the technology works, the validation trial and project updates, see
      <a href="https://moomore.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">moomore.com</a>. This page is about how I got here.
    </p>

